					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					16.10.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be repented of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
